
# <type>(<scope>)!: <Subject>          <- 50 chars max, whole line
#
# <body>                               <- what and why, not how. wrap at 72
#
# <footer>                             <- BREAKING CHANGE: / Closes #123
#
#   type   feat fix docs style refactor perf test chore build ci revert
#   scope  a domain: build sink gates icons tokens themes grid deps
#
#   1 blank line between subject and body   5 imperative: "Add", not "Added"
#   2 subject <= 50                         6 wrap body at 72
#   3 capitalise the subject                7 explain what and why
#   4 no trailing period
#
# docs/commits.md
